<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'">
<title>axis-migrate report — no sealed run</title>
<style>body{font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;margin:0;background:#fbfbfa;color:#1f2328}
main{max-width:860px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 16px}h1{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 8px}
.bar{background:#b42318;color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;font-weight:600}
.status-line{padding:10px 12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8dee4;border-left:5px solid #d03b3b;border-radius:8px;font:13px/1.5 ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{background:#1a1a19;color:#e6e6e3}.status-line{background:#222321;border-color:#33373c}}</style></head>
<body><div class="bar" id="integrity">No sealed run: nothing verified</div>
<main id="headline"><h1>No sealed run: nothing verified</h1>
<p class="status-line" id="status-line">{{ status_line }}</p>
<p>{{ meaning }} There is no sealed run in <code>{{ migration }}/runs/index.jsonl</code>. A rung is only ever computed
from a sealed evidence bundle, so this page shows no status. Run the pipeline, verify it, then seal the run with
<code>seal.py</code> and render again.</p>
</main></body></html>
